healthy |\\n\\n## Impact\\n- Duration: **35m 49s** (2,149 s), single incident all month.\\n- June availability: 30 days = 43,200 min → (43,200 − 35.817) / 43,200 = **99.917%**.\\n- Monthly 99.9% SLO: **met**, with only ~3.5 minutes of error budget left (43.2 min allowed).\\n\\n## Root cause\\n`/data` filled to 97% (old backups never rotated). Autosave writes hit ENOSPC, the server hung, and every automatic restart also died (exit 137) while the disk stayed full. The outage was self-healing only via disk space: it ended within ~80 s of backup rotation freeing 38.2 GB. The 06-01 RCON auth failure from 203.0.113.12 is unrelated noise.\\n\\n## Follow-ups\\n1. Alert at 80% disk on `/data` — the 97% WARN at 03:10 gave only 7 minutes of lead time.\\n2. Schedule backup rotation (it ran only by chance at 03:52).\\n3. Watchdog has no disk preflight; restart loop burned 34 of the 36 minutes. Fail fast + page on >5 consecutive exit-137 restarts.\\n4. Consider `SaveGame` failure as an immediate page, not just a log ERROR.\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Downtime window defined per README: first save error → \\\"server ready\\\" (matches this report).\\n- Full calendar month of June (43,200 min) used as denominator; only June 1–3 logs exist and README states there was exactly one incident.\\n\", \"path\": \"incident-report.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1793600298328,"end":1793600309535}}}}

